      "value": "<p><strong>Ironfist.</strong> <em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +@mod + @prof to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 1d8 + @mod bludgeoning damage.</p><p>The weapon carries the habits of its makers: iron darkened by smoke, edges nicked by old wars, and balance tuned for the cruel seconds when a line breaks. It is not an ornament but a battlefield answer, meant to decide distance, courage, and blood before mercy can speak.</p><blockquote><p>“The Old World rewards only those who turn fear into steel.”<br><em>— a scarred captain of the Empire</em></p></blockquote>",
